{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/354563-help-with-a-fan-made-hunter-conspiracy","id":354563,"title":"Help with a Fan-Made Hunter Conspiracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-30T01:30:11-08:00","id":354563,"title":"Help with a Fan-Made Hunter Conspiracy","content":"I've been playing around with the idea of a sort of Bounty Hunter Conspiracy. When I say &quot;Bounty Hunter&quot; I mean more in the Wild West meaning of the phrase than the modern one. <br /> <br /> It consists of a group of individuals who travel the Americas and sell their monster-hunting services to whoever needs it bad enough. They charge a shit-ton of money for their services, but they do great work whether it be dispatching a monster, or simply catching it and delivering it to the client in question. <br /> <br /> Part of their success has to do with their endowment, which consists of a specially made handgun which shoots custom made supernatural cartridges with varying effects to capture, incapacitate, or destroy their targets. <br /> <br /> The other part of their success has to do with their willingness to employ or befriend other supernaturals as accomplices, moles, and informants. <br /> <br /> Does this sound appealing as a hunter group?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T18:31:22-08:00","id":355291,"title":"","content":"It sounds like a valid group idea, I'm not sure if I'd make it a conspiracy though.<br /> <br /> Armory reloaded has rules for making weapons with supernatural elements to it like a rune stone or the ashes of a seventh son of a seventh son, so I'd have to see what you were thinking of endowment wise, they might work as a well armed compact instead.<br /> <br /> For example, something anyone with Occult 4 and the technical skills could make would be this gun, inspired by something from GURPS:<br /> <br /> The Scarmaker. Legend says a man found a mine with this unusual red gemstone deposit in it. He cut himself accidentally and was surprised to see that the blood that had fallen on the gem crystalized.<br /> <br /> Testing out the blood crystal's strength, he was surprised when it set fire to his metal workbench. <br /> <br /> He built a most unusual gun, it has no ammo magazine, instead a needle shoots into your hand, taking one bashing point of damage from minor blood loss for each shot. In return, those hit by the blood crystal bullets are set on fire: flesh, wood, water, stone, steel, to the fires of blood it is all flammable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 12-30-2014, 09:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T20:20:27-08:00","id":355377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/354563-help-with-a-fan-made-hunter-conspiracy?p=355291#post355291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For example, something anyone with Occult 4 and the technical skills could make would be this gun, inspired by something from GURPS:<br /> <br /> The Scarmaker. Legend says a man found a mine with this unusual red gemstone deposit in it. He cut himself accidentally and was surprised to see that the blood that had fallen on the gem crystalized.<br /> <br /> Testing out the blood crystal's strength, he was surprised when it set fire to his metal workbench.<br /> <br /> He built a most unusual gun, it has no ammo magazine, instead a needle shoots into your hand, taking one bashing point of damage from minor blood loss for each shot. In return, those hit by the blood crystal bullets are set on fire: flesh, wood, water, stone, steel, to the fires of blood it is all flammable.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Well, that's definitely interesting, but I was thinking a little differently. </span></span> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Like one cartridge would house a piece of gear from the God Machine, and when fired it would create a ten foot area of effect from the point of impact which would freeze all physical beings and objects in time for about a minute. Another cartridge would contain a piece of black stone from the Underworld (treated with white sage and herbs) which could injure ghosts and spirits. Another cartridge would contain a sanctified blade from a phurba which when shot at a supernatural wouldn't cause much damage, but would instead incapacitate their magical powers until the projectile was removed. And so on and so forth...</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-30T23:58:08-08:00","id":355511,"title":"","content":"I see, I'd go easy on infrastructure though, while technically technology it's blackbox technology that isn't really understood by anyone or mass produced. So if the conspiracy does have a time stopping bullet thanks to god-machine tech then it would in all likelihood be a single bullet, shared among all 1000 agents, and if the guy who has it loses it that's it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T02:29:05-08:00","id":355550,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/354563-help-with-a-fan-made-hunter-conspiracy?p=355511#post355511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I see, I'd go easy on infrastructure though, while technically technology it's blackbox technology that isn't really understood by anyone or mass produced. So if the conspiracy does have a time stopping bullet thanks to god-machine tech then it would in all likelihood be a single bullet, shared among all 1000 agents, and if the guy who has it loses it that's it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think I could revamp it to a token from the goblin market. You think that would be more acceptable?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T18:02:16-08:00","id":356123,"title":"","content":"I had a similar idea long ago. The way I see it your group could be considered the mercenary version of taskforce valkyrie. However as StSword said taking into account the wild west feeling you want to give them I would keep them as a compact. I envision them as an old and secretive society of bounty hunters who got lucky and formed by chance. Basically a bounty hunter was hired by a mage to take care of a supernatural critter, the mage gave him some magic bullets to take care of it. The bullets where so effective that the bounty hunter decided to kill the mage and keep his arcane knowledge to himself. He called some friends and used his new found occult knowledge to forge special weapons and bullets for his comrades. They started hunting supernatural creatures out of greed, to gather ingredients, knowledge and artifacts for more power. However as they began to get known people started to come to them to kill or catch other supernatural creatures. Seeing that they were already hunting them anyway getting paid for that sounded really good and that is how they began. What do you think?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-31T21:57:21-08:00","id":356267,"title":"","content":"Sure, goblin market purchase, relic (reliquary has a relic power for stopping time after all), supernal or abyssal artifact, plenty of choices.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-01T17:39:33-08:00","id":357093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/354563-help-with-a-fan-made-hunter-conspiracy?p=356123#post356123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I envision them as an old and secretive society of bounty hunters who got lucky and formed by chance. Basically a bounty hunter was hired by a mage to take care of a supernatural critter, the mage gave him some magic bullets to take care of it. The bullets where so effective that the bounty hunter decided to kill the mage and keep his arcane knowledge to himself. He called some friends and used his new found occult knowledge to forge special weapons and bullets for his comrades. They started hunting supernatural creatures out of greed, to gather ingredients, knowledge and artifacts for more power. However as they began to get known people started to come to them to kill or catch other supernatural creatures. Seeing that they were already hunting them anyway getting paid for that sounded really good and that is how they began. What do you think?</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds about right\u2026any ideas as to what they would be called?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-02T04:16:33-08:00","id":357386,"title":"","content":"Hum....how about something simple like the silver bullet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-02T11:08:17-08:00","id":357631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hellovg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/354563-help-with-a-fan-made-hunter-conspiracy?p=357093#post357093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That sounds about right\u2026any ideas as to what they would be called?</div> </div> </div> </div> The Sons(or Daughters, in this more progressive world) of Guns?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-02T19:29:38-08:00","id":357963,"title":"","content":"Hmm, spellslingers could be their nickname, how about something simple like the Smiths? Gunsmith, smith and wesson, the magical powers blacksmiths were once thought to possess.<br /> <br /> Or for something more western, Peacemakers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T16:44:29-08:00","id":358605,"title":"","content":"How about <i>The O.K. Riders</i>?<br /> <br /> I've been thinking about this, and part of me feels like a good historical precedent to this group would be Wyatt Earp (and his semi-miraculous survival in a number of gunfights) and the rest of his posse. <br /> <br /> Say, the reason Wyatt Earp survived the gunfights was because a sympathetic changeling saw fit to grant him enough luck to to go against overwhelming odds. Later in life, the changeling came and asked Wyatt to slay his former Fae master who was hunting him\u2026in exchange for that deed, the changeling would ensure his story was publicized for future generations (because before his story was publicized public opinion of Wyatt and his group had been negative). <br /> <br /> This would give my group a historical rooting, and would relate how a group could become aware of the supernatural world and the goblin market...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-03T16:50:02-08:00","id":358616,"title":"","content":"Also, their signature weapon--a gun which resembles a single barrel sawed-off shotgun with a bolt action--which shoots supernatural rounds would be called <i>The Banefire</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}